From ab30d46f2614c9bd213fcb37de326b1b41392b0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quiet-of-far <145577751+Quiet-of-far@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:21:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: piano_mca: add charge end threshold control

Expose only charge_control_end_threshold with a fixed five-point
hysteresis. Gate both the buck charger and charge pump while keeping
external input available. Use the stock one-byte 0x2003 charge-enable
command. Reapply on ADSP recovery, preserve stop state on failed reads,
and pause capped charging before system sleep. Verify the charge pump
stops before releasing its reference. Treat lost replies as unknown
state so disabling a cap can restore charging.

Signed-off-by: Quiet-of-far <145577751+Quiet-of-far@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/power/supply/piano_mca.c | 318 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 292 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

